      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAKOTA AVA (2) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 6th at this track in OPEN company. Form here at the trip sound including eight wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. JALAPENO GEM (8) missed the frame last time when fourth (30.89) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Form here sound including five wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and nine minor placings to her name from 15 starts. Key player if finds best. FANTASTIC SPIKE (4) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at Murray Bridge in a handy 29.64 beating My Picasso. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has put together a string of wins and expected to go close again. BLACK CHIP (1) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
